---
layout: base.njk
pageType: contribute
title: Contribute
permalink: /contribute/
---
<section class="standard">
  <div class="wrap standard__wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Submissions</p>
    <h1>Submit a regret.</h1>
    <p class="dek">
      We welcome contributions from people who have made at least one decision they would,
      with the benefit of hindsight, like to formally walk back.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we're looking for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>First-person.</strong> Your regret, not your housemate's.</li>
        <li><strong>500&ndash;1,500 words.</strong> Enough to commit. Not enough to spiral.</li>
        <li><strong>A regret rating, 1&ndash;10.</strong> Be honest. We can tell when you're not.</li>
        <li><strong>An answer to: &ldquo;Would you do it again?&rdquo;</strong> &ldquo;Yes, and probably will&rdquo; is an acceptable answer.</li>
        <li><strong>One lesson learned, optional.</strong> &ldquo;None, frankly&rdquo; is also an acceptable answer.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we are not looking for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Crimes. (Speak to a lawyer, not us.)</li>
        <li>Other people's regrets, dressed up as your own.</li>
        <li>Things that are obviously a flex pretending to be a regret. We can see you.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <form
      class="submission"
      name="regret-submission"
      method="POST"
      data-netlify="true"
      data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
      action="/thanks/"
    >
      {# Netlify needs the form name in a hidden field so the POST is attributed correctly. #}
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="regret-submission" />

      {# Honeypot — humans don't see it; bots fill it in and get binned. #}
      <p class="submission__honeypot" hidden aria-hidden="true">
        <label>Leave this field blank: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
      </p>

      <div class="submission__row">
        <div>
          <label for="f-name">Your name (or a credible alias)</label>
          <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="e.g. Cordelia Fenn" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="f-cat">Primary tag</label>
          <select id="f-cat" name="primary-tag">
            <option>hubris</option>
            <option>purchases</option>
            <option>work</option>
            <option>email</option>
            <option>grooming</option>
            <option>hobbies</option>
            <option>neighbours</option>
            <option>music</option>
            <option>public-shame</option>
            <option>optimism</option>
            <option>other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="submission__field">
        <label for="f-title">Working title</label>
        <input id="f-title" name="title" type="text" required placeholder="e.g. I told the barber to 'just have fun with it'" />
      </div>

      <div class="submission__row">
        <div>
          <label for="f-rating">Regret rating (1&ndash;10)</label>
          <input id="f-rating" name="regret-rating" type="number" min="1" max="10" required placeholder="8" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="f-again">Would you do it again?</label>
          <select id="f-again" name="would-do-again">
            <option>No. (Asterisk.)</option>
            <option>Yes, and probably will</option>
            <option>I genuinely can&rsquo;t tell</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="submission__field">
        <label for="f-lesson">Lesson learned, if any</label>
        <input id="f-lesson" name="lesson" type="text" placeholder="None, frankly." />
      </div>

      <div class="submission__field">
        <label for="f-email">Email (optional, in case we need to clarify a detail)</label>
        <input id="f-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
      </div>

      <div class="submission__field">
        <label for="f-body">The regret itself</label>
        <textarea id="f-body" name="body" required placeholder="Begin somewhere. The middle is fine. The middle is often where regrets live."></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="submission__foot">
        <p class="submission__note">By submitting, you agree to be edited, gently, by someone with their own regrets.</p>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Submit for consideration</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
